Christmas pudding is one of the things most people will eat over the holiday period (in the UK anyway!), I personally don't like it but......I LOVE THIS ice cream. You get a nice bit of brandy come through with additional cinnamon and nutmeg notes which overall fills your mouth with CHRISTMAS!

If you want to make this Xmas/Christmas Ice cream at home, you'll need:

475g Whole Milk
350g Cream (whipping or double/Heavy)
180g sugar
15g Golden syrup or Corn syrup or even Glucose
47g Skimmed Milk Powder
1.2g stabilizer (I used Xanthan gum here)
5g Ground Cinnamon
5g Ground Nutmeg
30g of Cherry Brandy @ 24% ABV (or whever you choose)

100g Christmas Pudding (either left over or cooked new) our had Brandy, Cider, Rum and Orange in. 

I URGE you to try this one as it is soooo good. 

